h Effects of Phenoxy Herbicides and Contaminants (Ranch Hand Advisory Committee); Notice of Meeting", "abstract": null, "publication_date": "2004-04-19", "document_number": "04-8720", "html_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2004/04/19/04-8720/advisory-committee-on-special-studies-relating-to-the-possible-long-term-health-effects-of-phenoxy", "raw_text_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2004/04/19/04-8720.txt", "dates": null}, {"title": "General and Plastic Surgery Devices Panel of the Medical Devices Advisory Committee; Notice of Meeting", "abstract": null, "publication_date": "2004-03-05", "document_number": "04-4983", "html_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2004/03/05/04-4983/general-and-plastic-surgery-devices-panel-of-the-medical-devices-advisory-committee-notice-of", "raw_text_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2004/03/05/04-4983.txt", "dates": null}, {"title": "Pulmonary-Allergy Drugs Advisory Committee; Amendment of Notice", "abstract": null, "publication_date": "2004-06-02", "document_number": "04-12365", "html_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2004/06/02/04-12365/pulmonary-allergy-drugs-advisory-committee-amendment-of-notice", "raw_text_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2004/06/02/04-12365.txt", "dates": null}, {"title": "Psychopharmacologic Drugs Advisory Committee and the Pediatric Subcommittee of the Anti-Infective Drugs Advisory Committee; Amendment of Notice", "abstract": null, "publication_date": "2004-01-12", "document_number": "04-502", "html_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2004/01/12/04-502/psychopharmacologic-drugs-advisory-committee-and-the-pediatric-subcommittee-of-the-anti-infective", "raw_text_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2004/01/12/04-502.txt", "dates": null}, {"title": "Science Board to the Food and Drug Administration; Notice of Meeting", "abstract": null, "publication_date": "2004-04-06", "document_number": "04-7676", "html_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2004/04/06/04-7676/science-board-to-the-food-and-drug-administration-notice-of-meeting", "raw_text_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2004/04/06/04-7676.txt", "dates": null}, {"title": "Request for Nominations for Voting Members on Public Advisory Panels or Committees", "abstract": "The Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is requesting nominations for voting members to serve on certain device panels of the Medical Devices Advisory Committee, the National Mammography Quality Assurance Advisory Committee, the Device Good Manufacturing Practice Advisory Committee, and the Technical Electronic Products Radiation Safety Standards Committee in the Center for Devices and Radiological Health. Nominations will be accepted for current vacancies and those that will or may occur through August 31, 2005. FDA has a special interest in ensuring that women, minority groups, and individuals with disabilities are adequately represented on advisory committees and, therefore, encourages nominations of qualified candidates from these groups.", "publication_date": "2004-05-27", "document_number": "04-11944", "html_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2004/05/27/04-11944/request-for-nominations-for-voting-members-on-public-advisory-panels-or-committees", "raw_text_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2004/05/27/04-11944.txt", "dates": "Because scheduled vacancies occur on various dates throughout each year, no cutoff date is established for the receipt of nominations. However, when possible, nominations should be received at least 6 months before the date of scheduled vacancies for each year, as indicated in this document."}, {"title": "Furan in Food, Thermal Treatment; Request for Data and Information", "abstract": "The Food and Drug Administration (FDA) is requesting the submission of data and information on furan, a heat treatment related byproduct that has been detected in certain thermally treated foods. FDA is seeking data on the occurrence of furan in food, on sources of exposure to furan other than food, on mechanisms of formation of furan in food, and on the toxicology of furan, including mechanisms of toxicity. FDA will evaluate the available data and will develop an action plan that will outline FDA's goals and planned activities on the issue of furan in food. Elsewhere in this issue of the Federal Register, FDA is announcing a meeting of the agency's Food Advisory Committee (FAC) on June 7 to 8, 2004.", "publication_date": "2004-05-10", "document_number": "04-10588", "html_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2004/05/10/04-10588/furan-in-food-thermal-treatment-request-for-data-and-information", "raw_text_url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2004/05/10/04-10588.txt", "dates": "Submit data, information, and general comments by July 9, 2004. Data and information received by June 1, 2004, may be shared with the FAC before or at that meeting."}]